Z||000013||ChadMan||01-06-2001||02:50 PM||||Change my mind how, jerpro?  I love 2M4's.  I loved my 84 Coupe and I love my 88 Coupe.  2M4's are inexpensive, easy to work on, and get great gas mileage.<P>Fact is, though, rev up a Duke to redline and let it fall back to idle - it goes "Zoom."  Rev up a 2.8/3.1/3.4 - it goes "Vroom," and makes 45-50 more hp too.<P>I was just making a dumb joke, you know.<p>[This message has been edited by ChadMan (edited 01-06-2001).]||||reg||5
